	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last ide3231cc4-b1c0-4700-a531-55f12f60e3ac" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="e3231cc4-b1c0-4700-a531-55f12f60e3ac">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditora60d6707-9939-43ce-9175-dc091dfcdb29" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h1 class="headline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">2026 Election Dates</h1><h2 class="subhead1" aria-level="2">General Election: Tuesday, November 3:&nbsp;<br><em>Polls open 6 a.m. &ndash; 9p.m.</em></h2><p><a href="https://citizenparticipation.westchestercountyny.gov/voting/early-voting-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Early Voting: Saturday, October 24th &ndash; Sunday, November 1st</strong></a><br><strong>Note: there are no early locations in North Castle, See link to County Board of Elections page for times and locations.</strong></p><h2 class="subhead1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&nbsp;<span class="hyperlink"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/3359" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><strong>General Election Sample Ballot</strong></a></span></h2><h1 class="headline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-level="2">Where Do I Vote?&nbsp;</h1><p><a href="https://voterlookup.elections.ny.gov/">Confirm You are Registered to Vote</a>. You can also call the Westchester County Board of Elections at 914-995-5700 to check if you are registered to vote.</p><h2 class="subhead1"><a href="https://citizenparticipation.westchestergov.com/"><strong>Westchester County Board of Elections</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;Website</strong></h2><p><a href="https://www.vote411.org/"><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=448" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="Vote 411"></a></p><h2 class="subhead1">Election Districts &amp; Polling Places in the Town of North Castle</h2><p><a href="http://voterlookup.elections.ny.gov/"><strong>Check your district or polling place</strong></a></p><p><strong>Districts 1 &amp; 9&nbsp;</strong><br>Banksville Firehouse<br>33 Bedford Banksville Road, Bedford</p><p><strong>District 2</strong><br>Westchester Chinese Christian Church<br>(next to Town Hall)<br>3 Bedford Road, Armonk</p><p><strong>Districts 3 &amp; 5</strong><br>North Castle Community Center<br>10 Clove Road, North White Plains</p><p><strong>Districts 4 &amp; 10</strong><br>Hergenhan Recreation Center<br>40 Maple Avenue, Armonk</p><p><strong>Districts 6, 7 &amp; 11</strong><br>Armonk Firehouse<br>400 Bedford Road, Armonk</p><p><strong>District 8</strong><br>H.C. Crittenden Middle School<br>10 MacDonald Avenue, Armonk</p><h1 aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-level="2"><br></h1><h1 aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-level="2" data-pasted="true">Voting by Early Mail or Absentee Ballot:</h1><h3 aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-level="2">*Application request must be received by Board of Elections by October 24, 2026.&nbsp;<br><br></h3><h2>Voting by Early Mail or Absentee Ballot is a two-step process.</h2><ol><li>You may apply for an Absentee Ballot in any one of the following ways:<ul><li>Request your Early Mail or Absentee <a href="https://ballotapplication.elections.ny.gov/home/earlymail" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ballot online</a> or download the paper application in English or Spanish with the New York State <a href="https://elections.ny.gov/request-ballot">Request a Ballot Portal</a>.</li><li>Or you can apply for a Ballot:<ul><li>By sending an <a href="mailto:BOE-WestAbsentee@westchestercountyny.gov">email request to the Westchester Board of Elections</a></li><li>By sending a fax request to 914-995-7753 or 914-995-3190</li><li>By mailing a paper application to the Westchester County Board of Elections.&nbsp;</li><li>By going in person to the Westchester County Board of Elections.<ul style="list-style-type: circle;"><li>The Westchester County Board of Elections has relocated to: <strong>445 Hamilton Avenue, 8th Floor, White Plains, NY 10601.</strong></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li>Complete and return the Voting Ballot to the Westchester County Board of Elections:<ul><li>Mail or Deliver in person to 445 Hamilton Avenue, 8th Floor, White Plains, NY 10601.</li><li>Dates and further mailing instructions are detailed on the New York State <a href="https://elections.ny.gov/request-ballot">Request a Ballot Portal</a>.</li></ul></li></ol><h3 aria-level="2" data-pasted="true"><a href="https://citizenparticipation.westchestercountyny.gov/images/stories/pdfs/2026/2026-political-calendar-quad-fold-12.9.2025.pdf" aria-describedby="audioeye_pdf_message" data-docaccess-url="https://citizenparticipation.westchestercountyny.gov/images/stories/pdfs/2026/2026-political-calendar-quad-fold-12.9.2025.pdf" data-url-hash="d02c93478a941c98374ca3270d532a7606a89f3fb0647e27c6db221a6be451e0" data-url-status="new">2026 Political Calendar NYS Board of Elections</a></h3>
    </div>

