        <h2 class="subhead1">Removal of Name from County Voting Roster</h2><p>Voters who have moved and want to remove their names from the Westchester County Voting Roster can mail a signed statement to:</p><p>Westchester County Board of Elections<br>Cancellation Unit<br>445 Hamilton Avenue, 8th Floor<br>White Plains, NY 10601</p>
    </div>

